  "_comment": [
    "P1's gamepad is on the arrow keys, with B on Z, A on X, Y on A, X on S, L on Q, R on W, Select on Tab and Start on Return. The mouse follows the host's mouse: its movement and its left and right buttons. Power and the second gamepad ship unbound. A key of the Uzebox keyboard is on the host's key of the same name, except the keys the gamepad uses (the arrows, Z, X, A, S, Q, W, Tab and Return), which ship unbound."
